  dialogueLines:
  - Hey, man! Weird question. Have you, by any chance, seen an unusually large worm around here?
  - Right. Sure. I wasn't expecting you to say anything weird. Anyway, keep your eyes open. This worm could change science forever.
  - Now we're talking! I'm talking HUGE. Possibly longer than a garden hose. Maybe even... two garden hoses.
  - Whoa, relax! I'm a worm enthusiast, not a criminal. Although, technically, I haven't checked whether worm enthusiasm requires a license.
